## Remaining status

This closes the named raw service-replacement seam only. Broad P18-V01 remains
open: arbitrary application-defined Java `MessageExt` subclasses and the
remaining source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow/reverse-export review.
Current-revision GitHub Ubuntu and native Windows P18-V04 evidence remain
absent, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker validation remains separate. No remote CI or
push was performed. Pre-existing Phase 19 working-tree paths were left
unstaged and untouched.
